mobends.config.animations=Animations
mobends.config.animations.tooltip=Every mob Mo' Bends animates, vanilla's and other mods', and the player's animations: preview each, switch it on or off, and export it for Blockbench.
mobends.config.general=General
mobends.config.general.adoptMobs=Animate other mods' spiders and zombies
mobends.config.general.adoptMobs.tooltip=Other mods' spiders and zombies drawn with the vanilla model take Mo' Bends' animations, keeping their own texture, size and eyes. Mobs with their own model or drawing keep theirs. Each mob also has its own switch in the Animations menu.
mobends.config.general.combineFaces=Combine face-only player packs
mobends.config.general.combineFaces.tooltip=Resource packs that only animate the player's face, such as Just Expressions, draw it on Mo' Bends' head while Mo' Bends animates the body. Off, such a pack replaces the player.
